message: >-
  If you use this software, cite this software and the associated paper when
  available. Add the public Zenodo DOI after the deposition is published.
type: software
title: >-
  Non-Contact Dry-Material Monitoring for Self-Driving Laboratories
version: 0.1.1
authors:
